Nice overlay! Honestly, I just went with the binary route to avoid source-build headaches. Dealing with `node_modules` hashes and updating build dependencies across major versions can get pretty tedious, so grabbing the prebuilt binary just saves a ton of friction.

I'm posting this on behalf of a colleague, this helped him with the issue

Personally, I can't reproduce the issue either before or after this fix.

